{"toolCallId":"call_32401e5dd3b348b4bd510b7bbb01be2c","title":"Ran ls, echo, rg","kind":"execute","content":[{"type":"content","content":{"type":"resource","resource":{"mimeType":"text/x-shellscript","text":"ls -la specs/zz-bench-authoring/001-completeness-min-percent/ && echo \"---REQ---\" && rg -n \"REQ-011\" specs/zz-bench-authoring/001-completeness-min-percent/spec.md && echo \"---TASK---\" && rg -n \"T013\" specs/zz-bench-authoring/001-completeness-min-percent/tasks.md","uri":"tool://preview"},"_meta":{"cognition.ai/preview_is_shell_command":true}}}],"rawInput":{"command":"ls -la specs/zz-bench-authoring/001-completeness-min-percent/ && echo \"---REQ---\" && rg -n \"REQ-011\" specs/zz-bench-authoring/001-completeness-min-percent/spec.md && echo \"---TASK---\" && rg -n \"T013\" specs/zz-bench-authoring/001-completeness-min-percent/tasks.md","workdir":"/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-michelkerkmeester-MEGA-Development-Code-Environment-Public/fcd93cd7-b3f2-45e6-b976-87fabe792df3/scratchpad/speed-loop/wa3f8a76d29/tree"},"_meta":{"cognition.ai/commandNames":["ls","echo","rg"],"cognition.ai/inferenceToolName":"exec"}}
